{"works": ["<section class=\"hero big wall\"><div class=\"wrap feature-room\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Available works</span><h1>Selected works, <em>researched before they are offered.</em></h1><p class=\"sub\">A small, changing selection of works by living and modern artists. Every piece comes with the evidence behind it: provenance, condition and an honest view of the price.</p><a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying\">Arrange a private viewing</a><div class=\"chips\"><a href=\"#rich-simmons\">Rich Simmons</a><a href=\"#audry\">Audry</a><a href=\"#slawn\">Slawn</a><a href=\"#freddie-peacock\">Freddie Peacock</a><a href=\"#opake\">Opake</a><a href=\"#jacobo-azagury\">Jacobo Azagury</a></div></div><div><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img src=\"{{ART:audry-prosopon.jpg}}\" alt=\"Audry, Prosopon\"></div></div></div></div></section>", "<div class=\"wall\"><section class=\"artist\" id=\"rich-simmons\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"artist-head\"><h2>Rich Simmons</h2><p>British contemporary pop artist. Self-taught, he rose from the street art scene to galleries across Europe and North America, combining hand-cut stencils, comic-book imagery and a punk spirit. Bespoke commissions available.</p></div><div class=\"works\"><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:rich-simmons-peace-not-war-blonde.jpg}}\" alt=\"Rich Simmons, Peace Not War Blonde\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Rich Simmons</span><span class=\"ttl\">Peace Not War Blonde</span><span class=\"det\">Spray paint and gold leaf on deep-edge canvas, 122 &times; 91 cm</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Rich+Simmons+-+Peace+Not+War+Blonde\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:rich-simmons-contemplating-peace.jpg}}\" alt=\"Rich Simmons, Contemplating Peace\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Rich Simmons</span><span class=\"ttl\">Contemplating Peace</span><span class=\"det\">Spray paint and gold leaf on deep-edge canvas, 122 &times; 91 cm</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Rich+Simmons+-+Contemplating+Peace\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:rich-simmons-stars-and-stripes.jpg}}\" alt=\"Rich Simmons, Stars and Stripes\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Rich Simmons</span><span class=\"ttl\">Stars and Stripes</span><span class=\"det\">Pop portrait. Details on request</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Rich+Simmons+-+Stars+and+Stripes\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:rich-simmons-skull-ring.jpg}}\" alt=\"Rich Simmons, Skull Ring in a Red Box\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Rich Simmons</span><span class=\"ttl\">Skull Ring in a Red Box</span><span class=\"det\">Details on request</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Rich+Simmons+-+Skull+Ring+in+a+Red+Box\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"artist\" id=\"audry\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"artist-head\"><h2>Audry</h2><p>CELLARIS: The Vestigia. Phygital works in which a generative system produces singular states that the artist selects and translates into physical form. Fine art editions on aluminium Dibond, each limited to 8 plus 2 artist&rsquo;s proofs, in 80, 100 and 120 cm square formats.</p></div><div class=\"works\"><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:audry-prosopon.jpg}}\" alt=\"Audry, Prosopon: The Face / The Persona\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Audry</span><span class=\"ttl\">Prosopon: The Face / The Persona</span><span class=\"det\">CELLARIS, The Vestigia, no. 04. Edition of 8 + 2 AP</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Audry+-+Prosopon:+The+Face+/+The+Persona\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:audry-forma-nova.jpg}}\" alt=\"Audry, Forma Nova: The New Form\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Audry</span><span class=\"ttl\">Forma Nova: The New Form</span><span class=\"det\">CELLARIS, The Vestigia, no. 09. Edition of 8 + 2 AP</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Audry+-+Forma+Nova:+The+New+Form\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:audry-vestigium.jpg}}\" alt=\"Audry, Vestigium: The Trace\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Audry</span><span class=\"ttl\">Vestigium: The Trace</span><span class=\"det\">CELLARIS, The Vestigia, no. 01. Edition of 8 + 2 AP</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Audry+-+Vestigium:+The+Trace\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:audry-numen.jpg}}\" alt=\"Audry, Numen: The Presence\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Audry</span><span class=\"ttl\">Numen: The Presence</span><span class=\"det\">CELLARIS, The Vestigia, no. 02. Edition of 8 + 2 AP</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Audry+-+Numen:+The+Presence\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:audry-eidolon.jpg}}\" alt=\"Audry, Eidolon: The Apparition\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Audry</span><span class=\"ttl\">Eidolon: The Apparition</span><span class=\"det\">CELLARIS, The Vestigia, no. 05. Edition of 8 + 2 AP</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Audry+-+Eidolon:+The+Apparition\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"artist\" id=\"slawn\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"artist-head\"><h2>Slawn</h2><p>Spray paint, oil stick and raw colour: exuberant, unsettled faces that sit between graffiti, cartoon and painting.</p></div><div class=\"works\"><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:slawn-3.jpg}}\" alt=\"Slawn, Untitled (Tears)\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Slawn</span><span class=\"ttl\">Untitled (Tears)</span><span class=\"det\">Details on request</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Slawn+-+Untitled+(Tears)\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:slawn-1.jpg}}\" alt=\"Slawn, Untitled (Bow Tie)\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Slawn</span><span class=\"ttl\">Untitled (Bow Tie)</span><span class=\"det\">Details on request</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Slawn+-+Untitled+(Bow+Tie)\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:slawn-2.jpg}}\" alt=\"Slawn, Untitled (Three Figures)\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Slawn</span><span class=\"ttl\">Untitled (Three Figures)</span><span class=\"det\">Details on request</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Slawn+-+Untitled+(Three+Figures)\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"artist\" id=\"freddie-peacock\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"artist-head\"><h2>Freddie Peacock</h2><p>Precise, cinematic figurative painting, with a signature single eye that turns every portrait into a question about who is looking at whom.</p></div><div class=\"works two\"><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:freddie-peacock-early-twenties.jpg}}\" alt=\"Freddie Peacock, Early Twenties\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Freddie Peacock</span><span class=\"ttl\">Early Twenties</span><span class=\"det\">Oil on canvas. Details on request</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Freddie+Peacock+-+Early+Twenties\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:freddie-peacock-desert.jpg}}\" alt=\"Freddie Peacock, Untitled (Desert)\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Freddie Peacock</span><span class=\"ttl\">Untitled (Desert)</span><span class=\"det\">Oil on canvas. Details on request</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Freddie+Peacock+-+Untitled+(Desert)\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"artist\" id=\"opake\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"artist-head\"><h2>Opake</h2><p>Graphic, high-energy compositions that take familiar cartoon language apart and reassemble it with a painter&rsquo;s control of line and colour.</p></div><div class=\"works two\"><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:opake-cartoon-cats.jpg}}\" alt=\"Opake, Untitled (Cartoon Cats)\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Opake</span><span class=\"ttl\">Untitled (Cartoon Cats)</span><span class=\"det\">Acrylic on canvas. Details on request</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Opake+-+Untitled+(Cartoon+Cats)\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:opake-alice-on-glass.jpg}}\" alt=\"Opake, Alice, on Glass\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Opake</span><span class=\"ttl\">Alice, on Glass</span><span class=\"det\">Mixed media on glass, framed. Details on request</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Opake+-+Alice,+on+Glass\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class=\"artist\" id=\"jacobo-azagury\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"artist-head\"><h2>Jacobo Azagury</h2><p>Expressive, heavily worked oil paintings of people and their surroundings: portraits and crowded interiors full of music and movement.</p></div><div class=\"works two\"><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:azagury-street-portrait-green-jacket.jpg}}\" alt=\"Jacobo Azagury, Street Portrait in a Green Jacket\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Jacobo Azagury</span><span class=\"ttl\">Street Portrait in a Green Jacket</span><span class=\"det\">Oil. Title to be confirmed</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Jacobo+Azagury+-+Street+Portrait+in+a+Green+Jacket\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:azagury-tavern-musicians.jpg}}\" alt=\"Jacobo Azagury, The Musicians\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Jacobo Azagury</span><span class=\"ttl\">The Musicians</span><span class=\"det\">Oil. Title to be confirmed</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Jacobo+Azagury+-+The+Musicians\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section></div>", "<section class=\"sec bg-cream\"><div class=\"wrap narrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">How it works</span><h2>Seen something you like?</h2><p>Every work is offered with written notes on the artist, the work and its price, and I check provenance, condition and title before you commit. Prices and full details are available on request, and I can arrange a private viewing or high-resolution images.</p><a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying\">Enquire about a work</a><a class=\"btn btn-line\" href=\"/contemporary-art/buying-and-selling/\">How buying works</a></div></section>", "<section class=\"cta\"><div class=\"wrap narrow\"><img class=\"logo-mark\" src=\"{{ART:logo-stacked-dark.png}}\" alt=\"Al Miller\"><h2>Looking for something <em>specific?</em></h2><p>Tell me the artist, the period or the budget. I search galleries, studios and private collections, not just what is on this page.</p><a class=\"btn btn-gold\" href=\"/contact/\">Book a conversation</a></div></section>"], "featured": "<section class=\"sec wall\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"twocol\" style=\"align-items:end;margin-bottom:56px\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Available now</span><h2>Selected <em>works</em></h2></div><p style=\"text-align:right\"><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/works/\">View all available works</a></p></div><div class=\"works\"><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:slawn-3.jpg}}\" alt=\"Slawn, Untitled (Tears)\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Slawn</span><span class=\"ttl\">Untitled (Tears)</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Slawn+-+Untitled+(Tears)\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:rich-simmons-peace-not-war-blonde.jpg}}\" alt=\"Rich Simmons, Peace Not War Blonde\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Rich Simmons</span><span class=\"ttl\">Peace Not War Blonde</span><a class=\"tlink\" href=\"/contact/?enquiry=buying&amp;work=Rich+Simmons+-+Peace+Not+War+Blonde\">Enquire about this work</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"work\"><div class=\"gilt\"><div class=\"mat\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"{{ART:freddie-peacock-early-twenties.jpg}}\" alt=\"Freddie Peacock, Early Twenties\"></div></div><figcaption><span class=\"who\">Freddie Peacock</